OL,3,GNEWSACity centre shop owners
OL,4,A'intimidated' by youths
OL,5,
OL,6,FShop owners in a city where scores of
OL,7,Fyouths congregated at the weekend said
OL,8,Fthey were facing "intimidating" levels
OL,9,Fof aggression and have called on police
OL,10,Fto better manage the issue.
OL,12,FMore than 100 youths gathered in
OL,13,FCarlisle on Saturday, with reports of
OL,14,Fstones being thrown, verbal abuse and
OL,15,Ffighting.
OL,17,FHelen Ryder, who runs Beadle and Hill
OL,18,FJewellers on Scotch Street, said there
OL,19,Fhad been problems for more than a year,
OL,20,Fwhile Joanne Palmer said her Flutter &
OL,21,FFern store on Rosemary Lane had been
OL,22,Ftargeted previously.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
