OL,3,GNEWSACity centre shop owners
OL,4,A'intimidated' by youths
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Allen, the Labour police and
OL,7,Fcrime commissioner, claimed dispersal
OL,8,Forders issued by police were "not a
OL,9,Fsoft touch" despite officers making
OL,10,Fonly one arrest on Saturday.
